        <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">Follow the musical adventures of a tranplant salon owner, her son Parsley, his pear neighbor, and their picture perfect friends in the garden community of Dirty City, Woodwork.</Text>
      </Paragraph>
